/**** Body Description input file ****/
1.1.0 		version - Program version
/*************************************/
/******** General Properties *********/
/*************************************/
false 			IsFix 		- [bool]	- The body is fixed w.r.t global reference system so there is no movement and no radiation terms.
/*************************************/
/********** Mass Properties **********/
/*************************************/
1025000.0 		BodyMass	- [kg] 		- Mass of water displace by the body.
0.0				COGX 		- [m] 		- Position of the centre of gravity along the X axis and w.r.t the centre of the global reference frame.
0.0				COGY 		- [m] 		- Position of the centre of gravity along the Y axis and w.r.t the centre of the global reference frame.
-5.0			COGZ 		- [m] 		- Position of the centre of gravity along the Z axis and w.r.t the centre of the global reference frame.
true 			IBR 		- [bool] 	- Define Inertial By the Radius of gyration.
0.0				IXX 		- [kg·m²] 	- Inertia w.r.t the X axis
0.0 			IXY 		- [kg·m²] 	- Inertia w.r.t the XY plane
0.0 			IXZ 		- [kg·m²] 	- Inertia w.r.t the XZ plane
0.0 			IYY 		- [kg·m²] 	- Inertia w.r.t the Y axis
0.0 			IYZ 		- [kg·m²] 	- Inertia w.r.t the YZ plane
0.0 			IZZ 		- [kg·m²] 	- Inertia w.r.t the Z axis
5.0				RXX 		- [m]		- Inertia radius w.r.t the X axis.
5.0				RYY 		- [m]		- Inertia radius w.r.t the Y axis.
5.0				RZZ 		- [m]		- Inertia radius w.r.t the Z axis.
/*************************************/
/********* Mesh Description **********/
/*************************************/
box 													BodyName	- [str] 	- Name of region containing the mesh for the body
box_qtflid.poly 										MeshFile	- [str] 	- File name of the file containing the mesh description.
0														LidType		- [-] 		- Type of Lid used to supress the irregular frequencies. ( 0: None - 1: From mesh file (It has to be named as BODYNAME_INT_LID) ) 
false                                                  	UseExtLid   - [bool]	- Use external lid to damp standing waves ( It has to be named as BODYNAME_EXT_LID ) 
0.0002                                                  ExtLidDF	- [-]       - External lid damping factor (Recommended values in between 0.0 and 0.2, usual ones around 0.01. The actual value required calibration with experiments)
/*************************************/
/****** Moorison Coefficients ********/
/*************************************/
false			UseMC		- [bool]	- Switch to activate/deactivate the use of the moorison coefficients
floater.mc.dat  FileMC 		- [str]		- File name of moorison coefficients description